00:11:35.027 --> 00:11:37.963
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,

00:11:37.963 --> 00:11:39.998
and other serious illnesses
and they need your help.

00:11:39.998 --> 00:11:42.634
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:11:42.634 --> 00:11:44.603
Stay safe.
Wash your hands.

00:11:44.603 --> 00:11:46.439
Wear a mask.
We love you.

